    "id": 114627870783,
    "body_html": "<p><strong>Krendora is the modern department store.</strong> Founded in 2026 in Miami, Florida for the way people actually shop today — online, often on a phone, looking for one good item at a time, not a cart full of stuff.</p>\n\n<p>We curate thousands of well-priced, useful things across kitchen, home, outdoor, pet, decor, tools, and a dozen other categories. Every product is chosen for one reason: it works. We don't carry items we wouldn't buy ourselves.</p>\n\n<p>Behind the brand is a small US-based team focused on three things:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Selection</strong> — broad enough to be useful, curated enough to be trustworthy</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Price</strong> — sharp, with free US shipping on orders over $35</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Service</strong> — your messages get a real human reply within one business day</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>We partner with established suppliers worldwide to keep prices low and selection broad. Orders typically dispatch within 1–2 business days. Delivery to your US address takes 7–14 business days from there — we keep this transparent because surprise shipping times are the fastest way to lose your trust, and we'd rather you know upfront.</p>\n\n<p>If something arrives that doesn't work for you, our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">30-day return policy</a> keeps things simple. Most refunds under $50 don't even require sending the item back — we'd rather you keep it or pass it along.</p>\n\n<h3>Reach us anytime</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>General questions: <a href=\"mailto:hello@krendora.com\">hello@krendora.com</a>\n</li>\n  <li>Order help: <a href=\"mailto:support@krendora.com\">support@krendora.com</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Our address</h3>\n<p>Krendora<br>\n1480 NW North River Dr<br>\nMiami, FL 33125<br>\nUnited States</p>\n\n<p>We read every message. We're here to make this easy.</p>",
