  {
    "id": 114627051583,
    "body_html": "<p>The fastest way to reach us is email. We read every message and reply within one US business day.</p>\n\n<h3>Order help</h3>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:support@krendora.com\"><strong>support@krendora.com</strong></a></p>\n<p>Use this for: tracking, returns, refunds, missing or damaged items, anything order-related. Please include your order number in the subject or first line.</p>\n\n<h3>General questions, media, partnerships</h3>\n<p><a href=\"mailto:hello@krendora.com\"><strong>hello@krendora.com</strong></a></p>\n<p>Use this for: pre-purchase questions, media inquiries, partnership ideas, product suggestions, or anything that isn't tied to a specific order.</p>\n\n<h3>Our address</h3>\n<p>Krendora<br>\n1480 NW North River Dr<br>\nMiami, FL 33125<br>\nUnited States</p>\n\n<h3>Response time</h3>\n<p>Within <strong>one business day</strong>. If you don't hear back in two business days, please resend — occasionally messages get caught by spam. We respond to every legitimate inbound.</p>\n\n<h3>Our hours</h3>\n<p>Email-only support, Monday through Friday. We don't currently offer phone support — it lets us reply faster, keep careful records, and stay focused on what actually matters: getting your order right.</p>\n\n<p>If you'd rather use a form, the one below works too:</p>",
