    "id": 114627903551,
    "body_html": "<h2>Where do you ship?</h2><p>All 50 US states and DC. We do not ship internationally yet.</p><h2>How long does shipping take?</h2><p>Most orders arrive in 7–14 business days. Free shipping on orders over $35.</p><h2>Can I track my order?</h2><p>Yes — you'll get a tracking link by email once your order ships, usually within 1–2 business days of placing it.</p><h2>What's your return policy?</h2><p>30 days, any reason. Email <a href=\"mailto:support@krendora.com\">support@krendora.com</a> to start.</p><h2>Is there a phone number I can call?</h2><p>We do support by email only at this stage — it lets us reply faster and keep detailed records. Email <a href=\"mailto:support@krendora.com\">support@krendora.com</a> and we'll respond within one business day.</p><h2>Are your products safe / authentic?</h2><p>We work with established suppliers and inspect new products before listing. If anything you receive doesn't meet expectations, contact support and we'll make it right.</p>",
